        "description": "Mild to moderate developmental delay or intellectual disability",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria (ocular malformations, mandibular hypoplasia, and limb malformations)",
